ncy cost, so FG% falls only slightly.","sources":["https://youtu.be/gerS7ibpaJo?t=803","https://youtu.be/0AptxcRW0RE?t=1073","https://youtu.be/6DnRWahYrFA?t=341"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}